**Given:**

Speed of boat in the direction of stream = 47 km/hr

Speed of boat against the direction of stream = 19 km/hr

**Formula used:**

Speed of current = dfrac{{Speed downstream} - {Speed upstream}}{2}

**Calculation:**

{Speed of current} = dfrac{47 - 19}{2}

⇒ {Speed of current} = dfrac{28}{2}

⇒ Speed of current = 14 km/hr

**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**
